#: /Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Item.ST_Item
msgctxt "ST_Item,Memory_Balrog_Content"
msgid "피의 요새의 군주였던 그는 강력한 악마 룬의 힘에 굴복했고 영지는 순식간의 악마의 성체가 되었다,"
msgstr "Once the lord of the Blood Fortress, he succumbed to the power of a mighty Demonic Rune. In the blink of an eye, his domain was transformed into a demonic stronghold."

#. Key:	Memory_FallenAngel
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Item.ST_Item
