#. Key:	ValkyrieRune_N_Content
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Rune.ST_Rune
#: /Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Rune.ST_Rune
msgctxt "ST_Rune,ValkyrieRune_N_Content"
msgid "달빛이 약하게 담겨있는 룬. 4번째 공격이 최대체력의 2% 만큼 추가로 회복한다."
msgstr "A rune imbued with a faint trace of moonlight. Every 4th attack restores additional HP equal to 2% of max HP."

